{"seq":1,"slug":"cpp-programming","title":"C++ 游戏编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming/cpp-programming","wordCount":1330,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"c-游戏编程\">C++ 游戏编程</h1><p>虚幻的 C++ 不是教科书里的标准 C++。它在标准语言之上叠了一层由宏和代码生成支撑的「方言」：<code>UCLASS</code>、<code>UPROPERTY</code>、<code>UFUNCTION</code> 这些宏把普通的类接入引擎的反射、垃圾回收、序列化与网络系统。写虚幻 C++ 的难点不在语法，而在于理解你写的每一行如何与这套引擎机制交互。本篇讲日常游戏逻辑编程的 C++ 实践；这些宏背后的反射机制如何工作见 <a href=\"reflection-properties\">反射系统与属性</a>，C++ 与可视化脚本如何互通见 <a href=\"blueprints-visual\">蓝图可视化脚本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>虚幻 C++ 的对象分两个世界：UObject 体系（继承 <code>UObject</code>，受 GC 管理，能反射/序列化/复制）与普通 C++ 类型（<code>FVector</code>、<code>FString</code> 这类以 <code>F</code> 开头的值类型，栈上分配或由你手动管理）。命名前缀本身就是契约：<code>U</code> 是 UObject，<code>A</code> 是 Actor（也是 UObject），<code>F</code> 是普通结构体，<code>I</code> 是接口，<code>E</code> 是枚举。看到前缀就知道它受不受 GC 管。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Code[你的 C++ 类] --&gt; Macro[UCLASS/UPROPERTY/UFUNCTION 宏]&#10;  Macro --&gt; UHT[UnrealHeaderTool 解析]&#10;  UHT --&gt; Gen[生成 .generated.h]&#10;  Gen --&gt; Refl[反射/GC/序列化/网络能力]&#10;  Code --&gt; Plain[F* 值类型&lt;br/&gt;不经反射]\">graph TD\n  Code[你的 C++ 类] --&gt; Macro[UCLASS/UPROPERTY/UFUNCTION 宏]\n  Macro --&gt; UHT[UnrealHeaderTool 解析]\n  UHT --&gt; Gen[生成 .generated.h]\n  Gen --&gt; Refl[反射/GC/序列化/网络能力]\n  Code --&gt; Plain[F* 值类型&lt;br/&gt;不经反射]</pre><p>下表对比几类引用持有方式，选错会导致内存泄漏或悬空：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>持有方式</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>GC 行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>UPROPERTY()</code> 裸指针</td>\n<td><code>UObject*</code></td>\n<td>强引用，阻止回收</td>\n<td>拥有/长期持有的对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TObjectPtr&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>UObject</td>\n<td>强引用（UE5 推荐）</td>\n<td>替代裸指针的现代写法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TWeakObjectPtr&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>UObject</td>\n<td>弱引用，不阻止回收</td>\n<td>缓存、可能失效的引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TSharedPtr&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td>非 UObject</td>\n<td>引用计数</td>\n<td>普通 C++ 对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"uobject-内存管理与智能指针\">UObject 内存管理与智能指针</h2><p>最致命的错误是用裸 <code>new</code>/<code>delete</code> 管理 UObject——UObject 必须由 <code>NewObject&lt;T&gt;()</code> 创建、由 GC 回收，手动 <code>delete</code> 会破坏 GC 的可达性账本。要让一个 UObject 被持有不被回收，必须把指针声明为 <code>UPROPERTY()</code>；GC 只沿 <code>UPROPERTY</code> 标记的引用做可达性分析，这一点在 <a href=\"../core-architecture/engine-architecture\">引擎架构与模块系统</a> 已讲过其架构含义，这里强调它对日常代码的约束。</p>\n<p>UE5 引入 <code>TObjectPtr&lt;T&gt;</code> 作为裸 UObject 指针的现代替代：在编辑器下它提供访问追踪和惰性加载支持，在打包后退化为普通指针、零开销。新代码应优先用 <code>TObjectPtr</code> 而非裸指针。对「可能已被销毁」的引用用 <code>TWeakObjectPtr</code>，访问前调 <code>IsValid()</code> 检查。非 UObject 的普通 C++ 对象则用标准的 <code>TSharedPtr</code>/<code>TUniquePtr</code>（虚幻自实现的引用计数智能指针，语义对应 <code>std::shared_ptr</code>/<code>std::unique_ptr</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容器-字符串与值类型\">容器、字符串与值类型</h2><p>虚幻自带一整套容器，不用 STL：<code>TArray&lt;T&gt;</code>（动态数组，对应 <code>std::vector</code>）、<code>TMap&lt;K,V&gt;</code>（哈希表）、<code>TSet&lt;T&gt;</code>。它们与反射、序列化、网络复制集成，且经过游戏场景的内存与性能调优。<code>TArray</code> 用 <code>Add</code>/<code>Remove</code>/<code>Num</code>，遍历可用范围 for。在热路径上预留容量 <code>Reserve()</code> 避免反复扩容是常见优化。</p>\n<p>字符串有三种，各有用途：<code>FString</code> 是可变字符串（重，避免在热路径频繁构造）；<code>FName</code> 是不可变、大小写不敏感、全局去重的名字（比较快如比较整数，适合资产名、socket 名、tag）；<code>FText</code> 是面向本地化的显示文本（任何要给玩家看的文字都该用 <code>FText</code> 以支持多语言）。混用三者是常见反模式——把 <code>FText</code> 当内部 key、把 <code>FName</code> 拿来拼接显示文本都不对。</p>\n<p>值类型如 <code>FVector</code>（三维向量）、<code>FRotator</code>（欧拉角旋转）、<code>FQuat</code>（四元数旋转）、<code>FTransform</code>（位置+旋转+缩放）是日常数学的载体。旋转优先用 <code>FQuat</code> 做插值与组合以避免万向锁；两点距离用 <code>FVector::Dist</code>，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d = \\sqrt{(x_2-x_1)^2 + (y_2-y_1)^2 + (z_2-z_1)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"委托与事件驱动通信\">委托与事件驱动通信</h2><p>虚幻的解耦通信靠委托（Delegate）——类型安全的函数指针封装。<code>DECLARE_DYNAMIC_MULTICAST_DELEGATE</code> 声明的动态多播委托能被蓝图绑定、能广播给多个监听者，是组件间通信的主力（如 <a href=\"../core-architecture/actor-component-model\">Actor 与组件模型</a> 提到的 <code>OnDeath</code> 事件）。非动态委托（<code>DECLARE_DELEGATE</code>）更轻量但不能蓝图绑定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  HC[HealthComponent] --&gt;|血量归零| BC[广播 OnDeath]&#10;  BC --&gt; L1[Character 播放死亡动画]&#10;  BC --&gt; L2[GameMode 计分]&#10;  BC --&gt; L3[UI 显示结算]\">flowchart TD\n  HC[HealthComponent] --&gt;|血量归零| BC[广播 OnDeath]\n  BC --&gt; L1[Character 播放死亡动画]\n  BC --&gt; L2[GameMode 计分]\n  BC --&gt; L3[UI 显示结算]</pre><p>委托让发送方不需要知道接收方是谁，符合本仓推崇的分层 DAG 思想：底层组件向上广播事件，而非反向硬调上层。绑定用 <code>AddDynamic</code>，记得在 <code>EndPlay</code> 解绑或用弱引用，否则可能向已销毁对象广播。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编译模型与迭代效率\">编译模型与迭代效率</h2><p>虚幻 C++ 的编译比标准 C++ 慢，因为多了 UnrealHeaderTool（UHT）这一步：它先扫描所有带反射宏的头文件生成 <code>.generated.h</code>，再交给 C++ 编译器。改一个被广泛 <code>#include</code> 的头文件会触发大面积重编。提升迭代效率的关键纪律：头文件里用前向声明（forward declaration）代替 <code>#include</code>，把实现细节下沉到 <code>.cpp</code>；这与本仓「barrel 只 re-export、控制依赖面」的直觉一致——减少头文件耦合就是减少重编扇出。</p>\n<p>UE5 支持 Live Coding（运行中热重载 C++ 改动）和 Hot Reload，但二者对修改类布局、增删 <code>UPROPERTY</code> 的支持有限，重大结构改动仍需完整重编。对纯逻辑微调，Live Coding 能省下大量等待。需要快速试错的高频迭代逻辑，很多团队选择放在蓝图里——蓝图与 C++ 的分工取舍见 <a href=\"blueprints-visual\">蓝图可视化脚本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>虚幻 C++ 分两个世界：UObject 体系（<code>U</code>/<code>A</code> 前缀，受 GC 管）与普通值类型（<code>F</code> 前缀，手动管理）。</li>\n<li>UObject 用 <code>NewObject</code> 创建、<code>UPROPERTY</code>/<code>TObjectPtr</code> 持有、GC 回收；绝不手动 <code>new</code>/<code>delete</code>。</li>\n<li>用虚幻容器（<code>TArray</code>/<code>TMap</code>/<code>TSet</code>）与三种字符串（<code>FString</code>/<code>FName</code>/<code>FText</code>），按用途选对。</li>\n<li>委托驱动事件式解耦通信，符合分层 DAG；绑定后记得解绑。</li>\n<li>头文件用前向声明降低重编扇出；Live Coding 加速纯逻辑迭代。</li>\n<li>相关：宏背后的反射见 <a href=\"reflection-properties\">反射系统与属性</a>；与蓝图的分工见 <a href=\"blueprints-visual\">蓝图可视化脚本</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"C++ 游戏编程","id":"c-游戏编程"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"UObject 内存管理与智能指针","id":"uobject-内存管理与智能指针"},{"level":2,"text":"容器、字符串与值类型","id":"容器-字符串与值类型"},{"level":2,"text":"委托与事件驱动通信","id":"委托与事件驱动通信"},{"level":2,"text":"编译模型与迭代效率","id":"编译模型与迭代效率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Gameplay 框架与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/core-architecture/gameplay-framework"},"next":{"title":"蓝图可视化脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming/blueprints-visual"}}